{"slug":"/students/subjects/english/phonetics-oral/sound-system-ipa/","source":"students/subjects/english/phonetics-oral/sound-system-ipa.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Sound System (IPA) — Phonetics","description":"","subject":"english","body":"<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/english/phonetics-oral/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Phonetics</a></nav>\n    <article class=\"card p-6 rounded-lg\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">The Sound System (IPA basics)</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Overview of IPA symbols for common English sounds and how to read basic transcriptions.</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"font-semibold\">Worked example</h2>\n      <p class=\"mb-2\">Transcribe: \"cat\" (broad transcription)</p>\n      <p class=\"mb-4\"><strong>Solution:</strong> /kæt/</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Practice</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-5 mb-4 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Transcribe \"ship\" and \"sheep\"</li>\n        <li>Identify vowel symbols for /i:/ and /ɪ/</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h4 class=\"font-semibold\">Brief answers</h4>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-5 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>\"ship\" /ʃɪp/; \"sheep\" /ʃiːp/</li>\n        <li>/i:/ = long front vowel; /ɪ/ = short front vowel</li>\n      </ol>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 to-orange-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.card{ -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}